### Testes da API PixelFix (REST Client)

### Teste da Rota Raiz
GET http://localhost:3000/

### 1. Cadastrar Cliente (pública)
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Carlos",
  "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
  "senha": "abc",
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "telefone": "47999990001"
}

### 1.1 Cadastrar outro Cliente
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Ana",
  "email": "ana@gmail.com",
  "senha": "123",
  "cpf": "98765432100",
  "telefone": "47988880002"
}

### 1.2 Cliente com e-mail repetido -> 409
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Carlos 2",
  "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
  "senha": "abc",
  "cpf": "11111111111",
  "telefone": "47900000000"
}

### 1.3 Cliente com campos faltando -> 400
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Sem dados" }

### 2. Login com senha errada -> 401
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "carlos@gmail.com", "senha": "errada" }

### 2.1 Login com e-mail que não existe -> 401
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "naoexiste@gmail.com", "senha": "abc" }

### 2.2 Login correto -> 200 + token (expira em 90 minutos)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "carlos@gmail.com", "senha": "abc" }

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Rota privada sem token -> 401
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes

### 4. Listar Clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{token}}

### 5. Consultar Cliente por código (cpf volta descriptografado)
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### 6. Atualizar Cliente
PUT http://localhost:3000/cliente/2
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Ana Souza",
  "email": "ana@gmail.com",
  "senha": "123",
  "cpf": "98765432100",
  "telefone": "47977770000"
}

### 7. Apagar Cliente (apaga também consoles e agendamentos)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/3
Authorization: {{token}}

### 8. Cadastrar Console (número de série fica criptografado)
POST http://localhost:3000/console
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelo": "PlayStation 5",
  "marca": "Sony",
  "numeroSerie": "SN-PS5-0001",
  "servico": "Troca de pasta térmica",
  "idCliente": 1
}

### 8.1 Cadastrar outro Console
POST http://localhost:3000/console
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelo": "Nintendo Switch",
  "marca": "Nintendo",
  "numeroSerie": "SN-NSW-0002",
  "servico": "Troca de joystick",
  "idCliente": 2
}

### 8.2 Console com cliente inexistente -> 404
POST http://localhost:3000/console
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelo": "Xbox",
  "marca": "Microsoft",
  "numeroSerie": "SN-XB-0003",
  "servico": "Limpeza",
  "idCliente": 999
}

### 9. Listar Consoles
GET http://localhost:3000/consoles
Authorization: {{token}}

### 9.1 Consultar Console por termo (número de série ou código)
GET http://localhost:3000/console/buscar/NSW
Authorization: {{token}}

### 10. Cadastrar Agendamento
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": "2026-11-10",
  "hora": "14:30",
  "idCliente": 1,
  "idConsole": 1
}

### 10.1 Outro Agendamento (data anterior, para testar a ordenação)
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": "2026-11-05",
  "hora": "09:00",
  "idCliente": 2,
  "idConsole": 2
}

### 10.2 Mesmo dia e horário -> 409
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": "2026-11-10",
  "hora": "14:30",
  "idCliente": 1,
  "idConsole": 1
}

### 10.3 Console de outro cliente -> 400
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": "2026-11-11",
  "hora": "10:00",
  "idCliente": 1,
  "idConsole": 2
}

### 11. Listar Agendamentos (ordenados por data)
GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
Authorization: {{token}}

### 12. Atualizar Agendamento
PUT http://localhost:3000/agendamento/1
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": "2026-11-20",
  "hora": "16:00",
  "idCliente": 1,
  "idConsole": 1
}
